      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 106371225,
      "text": "ハナハマサジ は、イソマツ科イソマツ属に属する多年草または一年草で、イソマツ属の中では、最も広く栽培されており、半耐寒性の短命な宿根草である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Limonium sinuatum」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Limonium_sinuatum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1195318655,
      "text": "Limonium sinuatum, commonly known as wavyleaf sea lavender, statice, sea lavender, notch leaf marsh rosemary, sea pink, is a Mediterranean plant species in the family Plumbaginaceae known for its papery flowers that can be used in dried arrangements."
    }
